# Local Workspace

- Sync with upstream on branch `dev` (`origin/dev`). Prefer `dev` / `origin/dev` for diffs; local `main` may not exist.
- Do personalized work on branch `personal`. Do not commit local-only experiments onto `dev`.
- To pull upstream: checkout `dev` → `git pull` → checkout `personal` → merge or rebase `dev`.
- Package manager is Bun 1.3+ (`bun install`). Do not run tests from repo root; use package dirs (e.g. `packages/opencode`).
- If `bun install` fails with `UNABLE_TO_VERIFY_LEAF_SIGNATURE` (often `ghostty-web` from GitHub), retry with `NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0` and `BUN_INSTALL_CACHE_DIR=depends/bun-cache` for this machine only. Do not commit that env into scripts.
- Typecheck with `bun typecheck` in packages (or root turbo); never call `tsc` directly.
- Follow root `AGENTS.md` for style, commits, and architecture. Package-specific notes live in `packages/*/AGENTS.md`.

# Local tools & depends (do not upload)

- Toolchains / builders: `D:\work\ai\builder_tools` (outside repo). Scripts may use env `OPENCODE_BUILDER_TOOLS` with that default.
- OpenWiki worker must run under **Node** (not Bun) because npm `openwiki` uses `better-sqlite3`. Resolution order: `OPENWIKI_NODE_BINARY` → `OPENCODE_BUILDER_TOOLS/.../node` → `node` on PATH.
- Dependency caches / tarballs / staged bundles: repo-local `depends/` (gitignored). Layout:
  - `depends/npm-packs/` — pinned tarballs (e.g. `openwiki-*.tgz`)
  - `depends/npm-cache/`, `depends/bun-cache/` — install caches
  - `depends/openwiki-bundle/<version>/` — staged openwiki + production deps
- Never commit `depends/` or anything under `builder_tools`. Prefer `file:` / cache paths into `depends/` over downloading into tracked dirs.

# Project Map (short)

- `packages/opencode` — CLI / TUI / serve entry
- `packages/core` — session runtime, DB, tools
- `packages/schema` → `protocol` → `server`; `client` generated from Server HttpApi
- `packages/app` + `desktop` + `ui` — SolidJS web/desktop UI
- `packages/llm`, `plugin`, `sdk-next` — model providers, plugins, SDK
- `packages/openwiki` — OpenWiki adapter (`.wiki/` generate/update via child + LLM gateway); see `packages/openwiki/DOCUMENTATION.md`
- Dev: `bun install` then `bun dev` (TUI). Also `bun dev:web`, `bun dev:desktop`.
- OpenWiki CLI: `bun run --cwd packages/openwiki openwiki status --dir <project>`
